{"name":"Basketry","hex":"#bda286","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"basketry","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The process of weaving unspun vegetable fibers to make a basket.","Baskets collectively."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/basketry"}],"entries":[{"title":"Basket weaving","blocks":[{"text":"Basket weaving is the process of weaving or sewing pliable materials into objects, such as baskets, mats, mesh bags or even furniture. Craftspeople and artists specialized in making baskets may be known as basket makers and basket weavers. Basket weaving is also a rural craft. It is also widely known in Middle Eastern regions such as Cyprus."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cd/Woman_weaving_baskets_near_Lake_Ossa.jpg/330px-Woman_weaving_baskets_near_Lake_Ossa.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Basket_weaving"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b4/Lucy_telles_Paiute_in_Yosemite.jpg/250px-Lucy_telles_Paiute_in_Yosemite.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b4/Lucy_telles_Paiute_in_Yosemite.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b4/Lucy_telles_Paiute_in_Yosemite.jpg/250px-Lucy_telles_Paiute_in_Yosemite.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Artist Lucy Telles and large basket, in Yosemite National Park, 1933","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALucy_telles_Paiute_in_Yosemite.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3d/Woven_bamboo.jpg/500px-Woven_bamboo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3d/Woven_bamboo.